  "description": "The target community is individuals who identify with or are targeted by the derogatory 'white trash' stereotype, often white individuals of lower socioeconomic status, as well as those who may be familiar with or sympathetic to the website 'farmersonly.com' and its associated community. The meme is designed to appeal to or provoke members of this group by using the term 'white trash' as a racialized slur and associating them with discarded items (crumpled paper), reinforcing social division and contempt.",
